			<blockquote class="mrgn-bttm-lg" style="font-size: 1.2em">
				<p>Countries from around the world are getting ready to send humans farther into our solar system, beyond the International Space Station. Nearly 400,000&nbsp;km away from our planet, the Moon represents a crucial stepping stone in humanity's quest to travel onwards to Mars.</p>
			</blockquote>
