            </video>

<span class="wb-inv">Ok</span>
												
						<p class="mrgn-tp-sm">Fifty years ago, Canadian expertise made humanity's first steps on the Moon possible. Now, Canadian astronauts reflect on that incredible lunar legacy, and look ahead to a future when Canadian astronauts could one day participate in a Moon mission. (Credits: Canadian Space Agency, <span title="National Aeronautics and Space Administration">NASA</span>, <span lang="fr">Héroux</span>-Devtek)</p>
						<p><a href="https://www.asc-csa.gc.ca/eng/multimedia/search/video/18336#transcript">Transcription</a></p>

